# BREAK up with the card's rune 1 (retrigger only) and with rune 7 (all):
# stays playing, finite, unclipped. Trig Out modes (Settings P2): Snare and
# Random fire too.
pot 1 0
pot 2 0
pot 3 0
pot 4 0.5
pot 5 0
pot 6 0.5
wait 3000
pot 1 1                    # BREAK full
wait 2000
mark
wait 2000
expect rms > 0.005
expect finite
expect unclipped
